   "like_count": 2,
   "cooked": "<p>While registering on the Gnosis forum, I saw the option to create an account using an Ethereum address. I decided to try it because, why not. <img alt=\":man_shrugging:t3:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/man_shrugging/3.png?v=10\" title=\":man_shrugging:t3:\"/></p>\n<p>My “why not” reaction is not exactly a deep analysis so I wonder what the community thinks. Is that a feature we would consider for our forum? What might you consider are the advantages or disadvantages of doing so? Is it even possible with Discourse (I <em>think</em> that is what they are using too but have not confirmed).</p>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/724b04a647fb9a2825004df368a631e3e10e7b52\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/724b04a647fb9a2825004df368a631e3e10e7b52.png\" title=\"Screen Shot 2021-10-14 at 9.30.00 PM\"><img alt=\"Screen Shot 2021-10-14 at 9.30.00 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"gj59KFBn6SS1gsK3kP8oZcEogn0\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/724b04a647fb9a2825004df368a631e3e10e7b52_2_10x10.png\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/724b04a647fb9a2825004df368a631e3e10e7b52_2_515x500.png\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/724b04a647fb9a2825004df368a631e3e10e7b52_2_515x500.png, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/724b04a647fb9a2825004df368a631e3e10e7b52_2_772x750.png 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/724b04a647fb9a2825004df368a631e3e10e7b52.png 2x\" width=\"515\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screen Shot 2021-10-14 at 9.30.00 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">775×752 70.9 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>\n<p><img alt=\"Screen Shot 2021-10-14 at 9.30.07 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"pzYKWLVYCGKPvXMF48QtgAqCzm4\" height=\"435\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/b3478c2f2a9a1890d3a9fca67ea85dec3dccb254.png\" width=\"460\"/></p>\n<p></p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/8995bcabfde73e4bbc431dab4ae9ba05d357fa2c\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/8995bcabfde73e4bbc431dab4ae9ba05d357fa2c.png\" title=\"Screen Shot 2021-10-14 at 9.30.17 PM\"><img alt=\"Screen Shot 2021-10-14 at 9.30.17 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"jD8dR6FP3OVMPG7CZ07FlqgDgja\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/8995bcabfde73e4bbc431dab4ae9ba05d357fa2c_2_10x10.png\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/8995bcabfde73e4bbc431dab4ae9ba05d357fa2c_2_601x500.png\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/8995bcabfde73e4bbc431dab4ae9ba05d357fa2c_2_601x500.png, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/8995bcabfde73e4bbc431dab4ae9ba05d357fa2c.png 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/8995bcabfde73e4bbc431dab4ae9ba05d357fa2c.png 2x\" width=\"601\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screen Shot 2021-10-14 at 9.30.17 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">771×641 78.6 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>",
