   "cooked": "<p>Interesting. It’s smart having Ethereum as an option to sign-in. That way we don’t block any curious explorers in the shorter-term, but actively bridge our community to where we want to be over time. I wonder how hard it’d be to start pressing all our toolmakers to make this possible.</p>\n<p>Here’s one possible implementation, with WalletConnect support. I can’t tell if this is what Gnosis used though:</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://talk.fission.codes/t/ethereum-login-for-discourse/70\">\n<header class=\"source\">\n<img class=\"site-icon\" height=\"32\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/6c4e0242aa67606d0abd36f2ae167b3f9733a636.png\" width=\"32\"/>\n<a href=\"https://talk.fission.codes/t/ethereum-login-for-discourse/70\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"07:08PM - 07 June 2019\">Fission Talk – 7 Jun 19</a>\n</header>\n<article class=\"onebox-body\">\n<img class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" height=\"350\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/bede2bbfc0dd4c920b8b57ff7206d400773cc782.png\" width=\"350\"/>\n<h3><a href=\"https://talk.fission.codes/t/ethereum-login-for-discourse/70\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">Ethereum Login for Discourse</a></h3>\n<p>Description Discourse forums can enable multiple forms of authentication for account creation and signup. Enabling an Ethereum login allows for native pseudonymous accounts in Discourse.  User Impact Who would want to use this and why?  Communities...</p>\n</article>\n<div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://github.com/fission-suite/discourse-web3-login\">\n<header class=\"source\">\n<img class=\"site-icon\" height=\"32\" src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/favicons/favicon.svg\" width=\"32\"/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fission-suite/discourse-web3-login\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a>\n</header>\n<article class=\"onebox-body\">\n<div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/345;\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/f044acab01aeafd5eba311043b53e5742c6663f1_2_10x10.png\" height=\"345\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/f044acab01aeafd5eba311043b53e5742c6663f1_2_690x345.png\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/f044acab01aeafd5eba311043b53e5742c6663f1_2_690x345.png, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/f044acab01aeafd5eba311043b53e5742c6663f1_2_1035x517.png 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/f044acab01aeafd5eba311043b53e5742c6663f1.png 2x\" width=\"690\"/></div>\n<h3><a href=\"https://github.com/fission-suite/discourse-web3-login\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub - fission-suite/discourse-web3-login: Web3 Ethereum login plugin for...</a></h3>\n<p>Web3 Ethereum login plugin for Discourse. Contribute to fission-suite/discourse-web3-login development by creating an account on GitHub.</p>\n</article>\n<div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>",
